# (HELMS forge-fix i2) begin (forge fix 2, the owner: "great helms look alike at 1x; make the variants bolder"): `when
# helmfam-great,<mass>` replace views, one bold outline per body-mass class (the first replacing view that holds wins).
# the barrel: a domed crown (no flat top), a brow lip that sticks out over a notched eye slit, a cross of breaths on the
# shadow side and a flared skirt resting on the shoulders; the sugarloaf: a pointed cone lit on its left facet.
# Written by the HELMS area tools/d2.py (D R drawn; U is D with the face details dropped; L is R mirrored and re-lit).
